# Every file here is byte-frozen. cache.appcache pins a sha256 next to each
# entry, so any end-of-line translation silently changes a file's hash: the
# console then treats the entry as stale, and a self-hosted copy reports
# CACHE FAILED or keeps serving an old build.
#
# Disable all text/EOL conversion so a checkout is byte-identical on every
# platform. Use -text (not "binary") so diffs still work on the JS.
* -text
